Error [E0930]: `#Layout` arguments do not match `Layout(kind: Layout, tag: IntType = I32)`
  --> tests/ui/layout_columnar_partial.jet:1:19
    |
  1 | #Layout(columnar: x, y)
    |                   ^
 Why: marker arguments use the same call grammar and typed signature as function arguments
 Fix: match the registered signature `Layout(kind: Layout, tag: IntType = I32)`
